tml_id":"single-cell-best-practices","implicit":true,"key":"w5KLhvJJ2u"},{"type":"admonition","kind":"tip","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"中文版","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"GXxN2mZEW5"}],"key":"FyBflKPLaW"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"A community-maintained ","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"NIJEBy8Uk4"},{"type":"link","url":"https://uniqjade.github.io/single-cell-best-practices-zh/","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Simplified Chinese translation","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"YfZbeuhxl0"}],"urlSource":"https://uniqjade.github.io/single-cell-best-practices-zh/","key":"xRePmcBp2K"},{"type":"text","value":" of this book is available.","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"rcQaT7CN6u"}],"key":"ARsWsA9MMV"}],"key":"Kh0v3JgG0c"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Introduction","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"uhfsLA1DFT"}],"identifier":"introduction","label":"Introduction","html_id":"introduction","implicit":true,"key":"mvadSXadBY"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The human body is a complex machine that heavily relies on the basic units of life - cells.\nThese cells exhibit remarkable diversity, varying in type and function, and can undergo significant transitions during development, in response to disease, or during regenerative processes.\nThis cellular heterogeneity manifests in their structure, function, and gene expression profiles.\nDisruptions to this delicate balance can lead to systemic dysregulation, contributing to severe conditions such as cancer ","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"ITfGjS76Xl"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"Macaulay2017","identifier":"macaulay2017","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Macaulay ","key":"facmCbZFpi"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"E39HkhELqh"}],"key":"Cv8PxYhgSR"},{"type":"text","value":", 2017","key":"lxOrDAuqCy"}],"enumerator":"1","key":"rK1wocGDGK"}],"key":"x5MYtxjnPx"},{"type":"text","value":".\nTherefore, understanding how cells behave under normal and perturbed states is critical for deepening our understanding of entire cellular systems.","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"iTPCsRgS9P"}],"key":"Knk9lGpFAI"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"To address this challenge, researchers employ a variety of strategies, with one of the most promising being profiling cells at the individual level.\nTraditionally, each cells’ transcriptome was primarily examined in a process known as single-cell RNA ","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"RFSh4Ey4zu"},{"type":"crossReference","label":"sequencing","identifier":"term-sequencing","children":[{"type":"text","value":"sequencing","key":"IAfb1ayvTq"}],"kind":"definitionTerm","template":"{name}","resolved":true,"html_id":"term-sequencing","remote":true,"url":"/glossary","dataUrl":"/glossary.json","key":"OJgfcJ1d0A"},{"type":"text","value":". However, recent advancements in single-cell genomics now enable the integration of transcriptome data with spatial, chromatin accessibility, or protein-level information.\nThese developments not only enhance our understanding of complex regulatory mechanisms but also introduce additional challenges in data analysis.","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"WQnA8PCH3H"}],"key":"b8k1r8NPwJ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1},"end":{"line":32,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Currently, analysts are faced with an overwhelming array of computational tools - over 1,700 methods dedicated to single-cell RNA-seq alone ","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1},"end":{"line":31,"column":1}},"key":"uLx8Q8Vrzh"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"Zappia2021_pre","identifier":"zappia2021_pre","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Zappia & Theis, 2021","key":"pLYUYaKUsU"}],"enumerator":"2","key":"ln9nbgwhJU"}],"key":"ZASMa4L9tT"},{"type":"text","value":".\nNavigating this extensive landscape to produce reliable, cutting-edge results poses a significant challenge.","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1},"end":{"line":31,"column":1}},"key":"BCvUdW94jJ"}],"key":"uHTz46fFqS"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1},"end":{"line":34,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"What this book covers","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1},"end":{"line":34,"column":1}},"key":"hdjulgON7i"}],"identifier":"what-this-book-covers","label":"What this book covers","html_id":"what-this-book-covers","implicit":true,"key":"OesS5Lgcwa"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"This book aims to guide both beginners and experienced professionals in ","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"N8nauF56Zr"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"best practices","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"alzdlN8H2j"}],"key":"Hh0OYpb93e"},{"type":"text","value":" of single-cell sequencing analysis.\nIt provides a comprehensive overview of essential analytical steps, from preprocessing to visualization and statistical evaluation and beyond.\nBy following this book, you will acquire the skills to independently analyze unimodal and multimodal single-cell sequencing data.","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"JBlGtlbFLq"}],"key":"Xgq2GPaNPG"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":40,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The recommendations presented are grounded in external benchmarks and reviews wherever possible, ensuring the approaches taught are both effective and reliable.\nAdditionally, this book is meant to be a living resource, constantly updating to keep up with new discoveries and the latest best practices.","position":{"start":{"line":40,"column":1},"end":{"line":40,"column":1}},"key":"zUBRaHYoYC"}],"key":"N7r54erPau"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"What this book does not cover","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"key":"MmEPSs4i6J"}],"identifier":"what-this-book-does-not-cover","label":"What this book does not cover","html_id":"what-this-book-does-not-cover","implicit":true,"key":"nLtOImXIAk"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":1},"end":{"line":48,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"This book does not cover fundamental concepts of biology or computer science, including basic programming skills.\nNor does it serve as an exhaustive catalog of all available tools for specific tasks.\nInstead, it emphasizes well-validated methods that have been externally benchmarked or recognized as community standards.\nWhen such external validation is unavailable, our recommendations are only based on o